        "title": "What are the benefits of this drug?",
        "text": "RHAPSIDO helped reduce itching and hives in adults with CSU. In both studies, patients taking RHAPSIDO had significantly less itching and fewer hives compared to patients taking placebo after 12 weeks. About half of patients taking RHAPSIDO had well-controlled symptoms (minimal itching and hives), and about 30% had complete relief from symptoms."
