        "text": "The most common side effects of EMRELIS include nerve problems in your hands or feet (peripheral neuropathy), feeling tired (fatigue), decreased appetite, and swelling in the feet, ankles, legs, or hands (peripheral edema).\n\nEMRELIS can cause serious side effects, including peripheral neuropathy, lung problems, eye problems, infusion-related reactions, or harm to an unborn baby."
