        "title": "What are the benefits of this drug?",
        "text": "Patients with hemophilia A or B with inhibitors treated with QFITLIA had a 73% reduction in bleeding events (estimated per year) compared to when they were receiving bypassing agents on-demand (estimated per year). Patients with hemophilia A or B without inhibitors had a 71% reduction in bleeding events (estimated per year) compared to when they were receiving factor on-demand (estimated per year)."
